# {{PROJECT_NAME}} security reporting

Report security concerns privately to {{CONTACT}}. Do not create a public issue,
pull request or response recording containing a vulnerability, credential, customer
information or paid catalogue data. Issues are off at launch.

Describe the affected SDK version, expected behaviour and a synthetic reproducer.
Do not attach keys, cookies, product exports or screenshots from paid cards. Contact
us first if sharing sensitive evidence is necessary. Do not test outside accounts
or systems you are authorised to use.

The API and storefront are live. This repository provides no bounty or
response-time guarantee. Supported SDK versions will be stated after a reviewed
release; the current tree is a draft.
